  "worked_solution": "Given nonempty sets $A$ and $B,$ if either $A$ or $B$ is infinite, then $|A\\times B|=max{|A|,|B|}.$\n\nAlso, note that ${2}^{{\u2135}_{0}}=c.$\n\nTherefore, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}|R\\times P(Z)| & =max{|R|,|P(Z)|} \\\\  & =max{c,{2}^{{\u2135}_{0}}} \\\\  & =max{c,c} \\\\  & =c.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
